### Security Notes

- Hermes API port `8642` must remain loopback-only.
- Hermes native dashboard port `9119` must remain loopback-only in the first release.
- Provider values and Hermes state contain sensitive credentials and conversations.
- The local `.env` file currently contains exposed credentials. Those credentials must be revoked and rotated; they are not included in this report.
- The GitHub token previously used in a command-line remote URL must also be revoked and replaced.
- Do not commit `.env`, `.hermes` runtime state, provider keys, or API tokens.

